                "description": "The 48 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull from AHI Hardware has 26 inch center to centers. it can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. This contemporary door pull has a satin stainless steel finish. Its longer length makes it great as a front door pull for both homes and commercial settings. \r\n",
